## Focused acceptance tests

Command: `cargo test -p wifimic_server control -- --nocapture`
Result: PASS — 7 passed, 0 failed.

The seven deterministic tests cover:
- Start plus Heartbeat beyond 30 seconds, with decoded Ack responses for every accepted command.
- Heartbeat timeout to Idle and capture stop.
- Failed capture start, 5-second retry, and same-session recovery to Streaming.
- Explicit Stop to Idle while preserving the session high-water mark.
- Strictly stale/replayed Start rejection.
- Exact-session mismatch rejection for Heartbeat and Stop.
- Streaming Start supersession, with one capture start and the old session rejected afterward.

